          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Josep tupchosiekyik, ak bikab gotab kwandanyi, Katogoste anyun awe amwachi Parao, alenji, Kagobwanja werik che ketupche, ak bikab gotab baba, che kimi emetab Kanan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak bichoto ko kayogik, ak icheget ko bikab tuga; ak kaget kechirekwak, tukwak ak tugukwak tugul che tinyei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eng’ yoto anyun ye kuurok Parao, koteebenak kole, Boisieng’wong’ ko nee? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olenji, Achek otwogiguk ko ki bikab tuga koboch ko ki mengech agoi kora, achek, ak kwanisiekyok agichek; si kobiit omeny emet ne kiguure Gosen; amu chi age tugul ne iyagisiei ko ng’wan eng’ Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.34",
